{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossDominance"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.dominance_of_kapCross_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.dominance_of_kapCross_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":231,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L231-L241","doc":"**`κ_t {s} ≠ 0 ⇒ μ ⊵ ν`** — Sagan's cross-shape dominance criterion in the\nform Thm 2.4.4 consumes it.\n\nThe conclusion is definitionally `SpechtClassification.partitionDom μ ν`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.polytabloid_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.polytabloid_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":217,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L217-L225","doc":"A polytabloid is never zero over a characteristic-zero field: its\nself-pairing is `|C_t|`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapL_polytabloid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapL_polytabloid","kind":"theorem","line":209,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L209-L215","doc":"**`κ_t e_t = |C_t| · e_t`.** The polytabloid is an eigenvector of its own\ncolumn antisymmetriser. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapL_kapL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapL_kapL","kind":"theorem","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L189-L207","doc":"`κ_t ∘ κ_t = |C_t| · κ_t`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapCross_of_eq_zero_of_clash","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapCross_of_eq_zero_of_clash","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L108-L172","doc":"**Clash ⇒ vanishing.** If `a ≠ b` share a column of `t` and (after transport)\na row of `s`, then `κ_t {s} = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapCross_of","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapCross_of","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L92-L99","doc":"`κ_t` on a basis tabloid vector is the signed sum over the column group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapCross_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapCross_apply","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L83-L90","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapCross","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.kapCross","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L73-L81","doc":"**The cross-shape column antisymmetriser.** `κ_t` for a `μ`-tableau `t`,\nacting on `M^ν`: `Σ_{π ∈ C_t} sgn(π) · (transported π)`.\n\nWith `ν = μ` and `h = rfl` this is `SpechtIrreducible.kapL`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.sign_transportPerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.sign_transportPerm","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L66-L69","doc":"Transport preserves the sign — it is a relabelling, not a rearrangement. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.transportPerm_symm_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.transportPerm_symm_apply","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L63-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.transportPerm_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.transportPerm_apply","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L60-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.transportPerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtCrossKappa.transportPerm","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtCrossKappa.lean#L55-L58","doc":"Relabelling `Fin a ≃ Fin b` as a group isomorphism of symmetric groups.\nDefinitionally equal to `SpechtClassification.transportPermHom`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}